<title>SWITZERLAND: Air UK adds third daily London-Zurich connection.</title>
<headline>Air UK adds third daily London-Zurich connection.</headline>
<dateline>ZURICH 1996-10-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Air UK said it was adding a third daily connection between London Stansted and Zurich as of October 27.</p>
<p>&quot;Morning and evening flight times remain practically unchanged in the winter timetable. In addition, Air UK will fly from London around midday and return from Zurich in the afternoon,&quot; it said in a statement.</p>
<p>It will service the route with a 31-seat Dornier 328.</p>
<p>-- Zurich newsroom +41 1 631 7340</p>
</text>
